9T22:30:09.915Z","1.0.0-rc.10":"2026-09-16T19:23:41.664Z","1.0.0-rc.11":"2026-09-17T02:17:00.446Z","1.0.0-rc.12":"2026-09-17T19:10:00.819Z","1.0.0-rc.13":"2026-10-02T08:27:13.873Z"},"license":"Apache-2.0","repository":{"url":"https://github.com/alchemy-run/distilled","type":"git","directory":"packages/axiom"},"maintainers":[{"name":"pear-alchemy","email":"michael@alchemy.run"},{"name":"sam-goodwin","email":"sam@alchemy.run"},{"name":"blankparticle","email":"blankparticle@gmail.com"}],"readme":"# @distilled.cloud/axiom\n\nEffect-native SDK for [axiom](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@distilled.cloud/axiom).\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @distilled.cloud/axiom effect\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\n```ts\nimport { Effect, Layer } from \"effect\";\nimport * as FetchHttpClient from \"effect/http/FetchHttpClient\";\nimport * as Axiom from \"@distilled.cloud/axiom\";\n\nconst program = Effect.gen(function* () {\n  const result = yield* Axiom.v2.getDatasets({});\n  return result;\n});\n\nconst Live = Layer.mergeAll(\n  FetchHttpClient.layer,\n  Axiom.CredentialsFromEnv,\n  Axiom.AxiomProtocol,\n);\n\nprogram.pipe(Effect.provide(Live), Effect.runPromise);\n```\n\n## Auth\n\nRequired: `AXIOM_API_KEY`, `AXIOM_ORG_ID`, `AXIOM_TOKEN`. Optional: `AXIOM_URL`.\n","readmeFilename":""}